*      FAP                                                              MCLOG000
*MCLOG         FAST LOGARITHM FOR MONTE-CARLO TYPE CALCULATIONS.        MCLOG001
       COUNT   250                                                      MCLOG002
       LBL     MCLOG,C                                                  MCLOG003
*                          NATURAL LOGARITHM                            MCLOG004
*                                                                       MCLOG005
*              CALLING SEQUENCE  TSX  $MCLOG,4                          MCLOG006
