 MCLOG TZE     1,4                                                      MCLOG010
       SSP                          IF ARGUMENT NEGATIVE, SET POSITIVE  MCLOG011
       LRS     27                                                       MCLOG012
       STQ     X                                                        MCLOG013
       SUB     =O200                V                                   MCLOG014
       XCA                                                              MCLOG015
